WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:03.110
“SCPs will come and go, we know that.

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:07.899
But the most important thing in life will
always be the anomalies at this containment

00:00:07.899 --> 00:00:08.899
site.

00:00:08.899 --> 00:00:09.899
Right here.

00:00:09.899 --> 00:00:10.899
Right now.

00:00:10.899 --> 00:00:11.899
That’s Family!”

00:00:11.899 --> 00:00:16.100
Thank you, Dr. Toretto, for that inspiring
speech.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:21.189
Family can mean many things to many people,
and when it comes to the bizarre world of

00:00:21.189 --> 00:00:25.100
SCPs: family can be found in some very unexpected
places.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:34.200
Take the two brothers Cain and Able - SCP-073
and SCP-076-2, respectively - as an example.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.660
Their shared history goes back centuries,
and from what little we’ve been able to

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:44.050
learn directly from the source: the two seem
to have the mother of all sibling rivalries.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:48.640
Able can become visibly enraged at the very
mention of Cain’s name, whereas Cain has

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:54.550
a more subdued response, calmly but firmly
urging inquisitive researchers not to discuss

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.670
the matter any further.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:01:01.110
Whatever bad blood came between them is not
fully known, but it likely has something to

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:04.440
do with the nature of their anomalous abilities.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:09.030
Cain had the power to drain the lives of plant
life with merely a touch, while Able had the

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:14.700
power of resurrection: returning from the
grave every time he was dealt a lethal blow.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:20.630
The two were natural opposites, and yet – they
were also, undeniably, family.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:25.579
And their case is not wholly unique within
the SCP Foundation, as there is another pair

00:01:25.579 --> 00:01:31.890
of completely antithetical beings in containment
who surprisingly share a family tree.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:38.799
And much like the dynamic between SCP-073
and SCP-076-2, there was one side of the pair

00:01:38.799 --> 00:01:42.610
that could express nothing but distress at
the mere mention of the other.

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:47.430
And it was, by far, not the one that most
would expect.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:54.479
Enter SCP-682 - one of the most deadly keter-class
SCPs that the Foundation had ever known - a

00:01:54.479 --> 00:01:59.659
reptilian monstrosity responsible for multiple
containment breaches, capable of withstanding

00:01:59.659 --> 00:02:05.250
the total punishment of weapons both conventional
and anomalous, and hellbent on following through

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:10.170
on the personal violent destruction of every
living being in existence.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:15.750
It is an anomalous creature so overwhelmingly
powerful and indestructible that one could

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.110
easily assume that it was incapable of fear.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:23.310
And in most cases, that would be an astute
observation.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:27.960
But not when it comes to the matter of SCP-999
- the tickle monster.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:35.140
In stark contrast to SCP-682’s viciousness,
SCP-999 is a bundle of pure unadulterated

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:36.550
bliss.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:42.409
Resembling a smiley-faced glob of sunshine
and honey, SCP-999’s main anomalous property

00:02:42.409 --> 00:02:46.910
is its ability to bring lasting joy to all
beings that interact with it.

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:51.530
Prolonged contact with the little guy has
even been proven to cure depression and ease

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.530
trauma.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:58.410
What’s more, SCP-999 seems to actively seek
out others to share these benefits with and

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:02.670
often does so through play or other forms
of socialization.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:08.159
SCP-999 is benevolent in just about every
way that a being could be, and that makes

00:03:08.159 --> 00:03:12.410
it very different from most of the sapient
anomalies in containment.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:17.920
It is especially different from SCP-682, even
though they have a common origin.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:24.890
While the family resemblance is far from striking,
these two SCPs are half-siblings - not as

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:29.970
closely related as Cain and Able - but that
is still a lot closer than most researchers

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.349
would expect.

00:03:31.349 --> 00:03:36.319
Both of them were allegedly born from human
mothers who had undergone a horrific ritual

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:41.360
at the hands of an obscure cult known as the
Children of The Scarlet King.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:46.090
As the ominous name of the cult implies, the
members of the Children of The Scarlet King

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:50.349
worshiped a nightmarish deity known as The
Scarlet King.

00:03:50.349 --> 00:03:54.709
This interdimensional superbeing has become
known to the SCP Foundation as one of the

00:03:54.709 --> 00:04:00.540
most threatening anomalous forces in existence,
and some have even suggested that The Scarlet

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:06.099
King is the ultimate threat that the Foundation
must overcome if they wish to achieve their

00:04:06.099 --> 00:04:07.099
goals.

00:04:07.099 --> 00:04:11.730
To put it a different way, The Scarlet King
is like the last boss of a traditional RPG

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:17.669
video game: a primal source of all evil and
suffering in the world, which must be defeated

00:04:17.669 --> 00:04:18.930
at any cost.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:23.949
His powers are so great that our world is
merely one of many that he aims to conquer

00:04:23.949 --> 00:04:28.760
and reduce to rubble and ruin, and all of
us mortals can take a bit of solace in the

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:33.630
fact that the Scarlet King’s split interests
mean that he is unlikely to invade our world

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:35.630
directly anytime soon.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:40.860
He is not without his schemes and contingencies,
though, of which the vile machinations of

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.340
The Children of Scarlet King were surely one.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:51.250
The two ordinary human women who would go
on to give birth to both SCP-682 and SCP-999

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:55.840
were part of a group of seven individuals
total - all of whom had been imprisoned by

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:00.009
the Children of The Scarlet King and were
found in the late stages of pregnancy at the

00:05:00.009 --> 00:05:01.539
cult’s compound.

00:05:01.539 --> 00:05:06.650
Upon being discovered by the SCP Foundation,
these women were placed in containment and

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:09.720
designated SCP-231.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:15.340
Over the duration of their containment, the
instances of SCP-231 have given birth to various

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.820
anomalies.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:21.160
Most of these anomalies have been catastrophically
dangerous keter-class anomalies and have each

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:24.160
been the cause of hundreds of casualties.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:29.020
Those which could be destroyed through violence
were neutralized before ever receiving a designation,

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:35.530
with the obvious exception being SCP-682:
despite the Foundation’s best efforts.

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:41.430
Even more exceptional is SCP-999 - which while
just as anomalous and nigh-indestructible

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:46.560
as the others, did not share its siblings'
capacity for cruelty and slaughter.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:51.800
Of all the humans that were unlucky enough
to become part of SCP-231, only the mother

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:58.000
of SCP-999 was able to survive and make a
full recovery from the trauma she suffered

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.900
at the hands of the cult.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:05.360
This unexpectedly happy outcome was apparently
thanks to SCP-999’s ability to heal those

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:09.190
around it, including its human mother.

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:15.380
SCP-682, the hard-to-destroy reptile, and
SCP-999, the tickle monster, are the two most

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:20.990
notable members of the SCP-231 brood, and
while the Scarlet King had more than likely

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:25.740
hoped that his actual biological children
would join forces to drown our world in misery

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:29.540
and pain, this will most likely never come
to pass.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:37.610
This is because SCP-682 and SCP-999 are like
oil and water, and the one that has been successful

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:43.180
in rising above the other has unmistakably
been SCP-999.

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:47.699
This surprising truth became known to the
Foundation after a rather eventful cross-test

00:06:47.699 --> 00:06:52.680
between the two most contrary spawn of the
Scarlet King, and the findings from that experiment

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:57.220
point towards a possible long-term solution
in dealing with the interdimensional elder

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:01.850
evil as well as his children - adopted or
otherwise.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:06.800
The cross-test was the product of resilient
optimism from the research team, who, against

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:11.780
all odds, were willing to bet that SCP-999
could survive an encounter with one of the

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.940
most infamous Keter class SCPs the Foundation
had on record.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:20.100
Nobody could be one hundred percent sure that
999 would come out of the test unscathed,

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:25.490
and there was not an insubstantial amount
of fear as everyone’s favorite glob of goodness

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:29.750
was wheeled into a shared containment for
the experiment to be carried out.

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:35.370
However, the mere presence of SCP-999 did
soothe a great deal of the worried souls,

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:39.590
which only instilled more confidence in the
head researchers that this would lead to a

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:40.720
success.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:47.389
Once SCP-999 was alone in the cell with SCP-682,
the main event could begin.

00:07:47.389 --> 00:07:53.140
SCP-682 had been subject to a wide variety
of cross-tests during its time in containment,

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:58.830
and having never met or been aware of SCP-999
prior to the test, was cautiously staring

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:02.330
the creature down: prepared for the absolute
worst.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:07.890
With a beaming smile on its face, SCP-999
slid forward towards the reptile, causing

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:11.830
the keter-class SCP to instinctively step
backward in response.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:17.490
There was something deeply unsettling about
this gooey little glob to SCP-682, but it

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:20.460
couldn’t fathom what from appearance.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:22.729
The overseers of the cross-test were stunned.

00:08:22.729 --> 00:08:28.090
The sight of SCP-682 retreating from an entity
was rare, to say the least, and the adorable,

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:34.190
unimposing shape of SCP-999 made the scene
playing out inside the containment area especially

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:35.190
surreal.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:41.510
But no matter how unlikely it seemed, SCP-999
had begun the sibling playdate with an insurmountable

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:43.899
psychological advantage.

00:08:43.899 --> 00:08:49.700
As the tickle monster moved ever closer, SCP-682
found itself backed into a corner.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:54.010
With no further options, the reptile brought
one of its massive claws down on top of the

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.380
smiling blob.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:09:00.250
The entire mass of SCP-999 was splattered
into jelly upon impact.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.820
For a moment, it seemed as though that was
it.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:07.990
The researchers held their breath in shock,
hoping that SCP-999 would pull through.

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.220
And then, their wish came true.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:15.579
The amorphous form of SCP-999 began to reshape
itself into the recognizable form that we

00:09:15.579 --> 00:09:17.300
all know and love.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:21.940
It proceeded to crawl up SCP-682’s body
towards the nape of its neck.

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:27.490
Once there, the tickle monster began doing
what it does best: cuddles and lots of them.

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:32.330
SCP-682 was certainly caught off guard by
this unusual occurrence, and more than that:

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:37.149
it was falling fast under SCP-999’s spell
of benevolence.

00:09:37.149 --> 00:09:41.630
The lizard began to stomp its claws, overcome
with sudden bouts of uproarious laughter.

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:46.390
It began to vocalize in a way that seemed
uncharacteristically enthusiastic for the

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:48.220
keter class anomaly.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:49.220
“Happy!

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.220
Happy!

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:51.660
I feel so happy!”

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:55.800
repeated SCP-682, as it rolled around and
thrashed in the cross-testing containment

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:56.800
chamber.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:10:01.310
The merciless tickling from SCP-999 looked
like it would be torturous for the big reptile

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:04.279
to endure if it wasn’t so much fun.

00:10:04.279 --> 00:10:09.240
On the sidelines, the Foundation personnel
cheered on their wonderful little friend SCP-999,

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:13.220
as it continued to tickle SCP-682 without
stopping.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:18.459
Some of the staff present were even sporting
custom T-shirts that read “SCP-999 literally

00:10:18.459 --> 00:10:19.959
cured my depression.”

00:10:19.959 --> 00:10:24.320
The tickle monster did have a large fanbase
within its containment facility, after all,

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:28.340
and returning some of the good vibes that
the anomaly had provided seemed like the right

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.340
thing to do at a time like this.

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:36.389
SCP-682’s fits of laughter continued for
a long while, and the more it went on, the

00:10:36.389 --> 00:10:40.050
more it seemed that SCP-682 was becoming tired.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:45.389
SCP-999, seeming to sense its sibling’s
energy level decreasing, ceased the relentless

00:10:45.389 --> 00:10:50.630
tickling and instead began to nuzzle SCP-682
and purr into the lizard’s ears.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:57.709
Slowly, the quiet and pleasant sounds of SCP-999
lulled SCP-682 into a peaceful slumber.

00:10:57.709 --> 00:11:01.640
The hard-to-destroy reptile curled up on the
floor of the containment cell, almost like

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:05.450
a sleeping cat, and began to gently snore
away.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:11.410
Once its older and more cantankerous sibling
had fallen completely asleep, SCP-999 slithered

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:17.410
off SCP-682’s back and settled down nearby
to rest its own eyes.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:21.390
The research team couldn’t help but smile
and observe for several minutes before eventually

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:24.910
removing SCP-999 from the cross-test containment
cell.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:30.440
Predictably this caused SCP-682 to revert
back to its usual violent behavior and a containment

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:32.480
breach ensued shortly after.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:38.380
However, the casualties were kept to minimum
as SCP-999 bravely helped escort several dozen

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.390
Foundation personnel to safety by itself.

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.940
What would we do without you, SCP-999?

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:49.149
We know what SCP-682 would do without SCP-999,
of course.

00:11:49.149 --> 00:11:52.029
The hard-to-destroy reptile would be far less
threatened.

00:11:52.029 --> 00:11:58.170
While SCP-999 has expressed continued interest
in another playdate with SCP-682, the exact

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:01.950
opposite sentiment has been reported from
its reptilian sibling.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:08.270
And it's not simply a lack of affection, there
is an underlying fear that motivates SCP-682’s

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:12.600
desire to never interact with SCP-999 again.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:17.399
While some researchers speculated that SCP-682
felt an incredible sense of shame when it

00:12:17.399 --> 00:12:22.030
was observed being tickled, this is more of
an armchair assumption that projects typical

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:24.960
human psychology onto an anomalous being.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:31.579
We can’t forget that SCP-682 was born of
the Scarlet King, and while SCP-999 possesses

00:12:31.579 --> 00:12:37.440
the inverse of its father’s traits, SCP-682
might have directly inherited the template

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.760
for its emotional intelligence from that very
same being.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:46.760
While most well-adjusted humans try to avoid
supposedly negative stimuli – such as embarrassment,

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:51.990
anger, sadness, and fear – and seek out
positive stimuli i.e. happiness, pleasure,

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:57.579
security, and trust: alien beings with twisted
minds like the Scarlet King might have these

00:12:57.579 --> 00:12:59.579
priorities reversed.

00:12:59.579 --> 00:13:06.790
To SCP-682, all other living things are disgusting,
and it wishes to destroy them, but when this

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:12.740
tendency is examined with the context of both
SCP-999 and what we know about the Scarlet

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:18.779
King, it becomes clear that SCP-682 isn’t
an excessively prideful being.

00:13:18.779 --> 00:13:25.080
Moreover, SCP-682 doesn’t believe that it
is doing the world or itself a service by

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:28.440
eliminating the aforementioned disgusting
beings.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:35.650
We’ve theorized that SCP-682 and SCP-999
are equal and opposite, but if that proves

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:42.180
to be true on the level of internal psyche,
SCP-682 might compulsively attack other beings

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:46.500
for the same reason that SCP-999 comforts
them.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:52.180
It is a continuous expression of empathy,
or more accurately: whatever one might call

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.529
the impossible inverse of empathy.

00:13:55.529 --> 00:14:00.921
SCP-682 and The Scarlet King are not merely
indifferent to the suffering of others: both

00:14:00.921 --> 00:14:05.089
of them need to be in the presence of those
suffering beings in order to feel any sense

00:14:05.089 --> 00:14:08.030
of meaning in their existence.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:13.870
After all: love is the strongest emotion,
but hate is the second strongest emotion.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:20.970
Imagine now, if you can, why SCP-682 fears
SCP-999: a being that represents every unwanted

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:26.490
sensation and emotion that it lives its immortal
life hoping to avoid.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:36.470
In the eyes of SCP-682, SCP-999 is precisely
as horrifying as the reptile is to ourselves.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:38.070
Want an anomaly of your own?

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:41.570
Check out www.scpswag.com for high-quality
SCP merch!

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:47.589
Now go check out “SCP-001 No Match For The
Tickle Monster!” and “What Does SCP-999

00:14:47.589 --> 00:14:48.589
Do All Day?

00:14:48.589 --> 00:14:51.680
(Hour by Hour)” for more adventures with
SCP-999!

